    797: "אַשְׁדֹּודִית (ʼAshdôwdîyth | ash-do-deeth')<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> feminine of H796 אַשְׁדֹּודִי<BR><B>Strong's:</B> (only adverb) in the language of Ashdod<BR><B>KJV:</B> in the speech of Ashdod.<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> H794 (springs), H797 (in the speech of Ashdod), H793 (stream), H796 (Ashdodites), H795 (Ahdod)",
