    800: "אֶשָּׁה (ʼeshshâh | esh-shaw')<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> feminine of H784 אֵשׁ<BR><B>Strong's:</B> fire<BR><B>KJV:</B> fire.<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> H801 (by fire), H784 (burning), H786 (are there), H789 (Ashbelites), H788 (Ashbel), H799 (fiery law), H790 (Eshban), H791 (Ashbea), H800 (fire), H792 (Eshbaal)",
    801: "אִשָּׁה (ʼishshâh | ish-shaw')<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> the same as H800 אֶשָּׁה, but used in a liturgical sense<BR><B>Strong's:</B> properly, a burnt-offering; but occasionally of any sacrifice<BR><B>KJV:</B> (offering, sacrifice), (made) by fire.<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> H801 (by fire), H784 (burning), H786 (are there), H789 (Ashbelites), H788 (Ashbel), H799 (fiery law), H790 (Eshban), H791 (Ashbea), H800 (fire), H792 (Eshbaal)<BR><B>Greek Equivalents:</B> G2368 θυμίαμα, G2378 θυσία, G3646 ὁλοκαύτωμα",
    802: "אִשָּׁה (ʼishshâh | ish-shaw')<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> feminine of H376 אִישׁ or H582 אֱנֹושׁ ; irregular plural, נָשִׁים;(used in the same wide sense as H582 אֱנֹושׁ)<BR><BR><B>Strong's:</B> a woman<BR><B>KJV:</B> (adulter) ess, each, every, female, [idiom] many, [phrase] none, one, [phrase] together, wife, woman. Often unexpressed in English.<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> H802 (ess)<BR><B>Greek Equivalents:</B> G1134 γυναικεῖος, G1135 γυνή, G2233 ἡγέομαι, G2338 θῆλυς, G2364 θυγάτηρ, G2877 κοράσιον, G3384 μήτηρ",
