    813: "אַשְׁכְּנַז (ʼAshkᵉnaz | ash-ken-az')<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> of foreign origin<BR><B>Strong's:</B> Ashkenaz, a Japhethite, also his descendants<BR><B>KJV:</B> Ashkenaz.<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> H2977 (Josiah), H810 (stone), H805 (Asshurim), H807 (Ashima), H804 (Asshur), H803 (foundation), H812 (Eshcol), H811 (cluster), H813 (Ashkenaz)",
