    836: "אָשֵׁר (ʼÂshêr | aw-share')<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> from H833 אָשַׁר,<BR><B>Strong's:</B> happy; Asher, a son of Jacob, and the tribe descended from him, with its territory; also a place in Palestine<BR><B>KJV:</B> Asher<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> H843 (Asherites), H835 (blessed), H838 (going), H842 (grove), H837 (happy), H836 (Asher), H833 (bless), H839 (Ashurite), H8391 (box)<BR><B>Greek Equivalents:</B> G768 Ἀσήρ",
    837: "אֹשֶׁר (ʼôsher | o'-sher)<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> from H833 אָשַׁר<BR><B>Strong's:</B> happiness<BR><B>KJV:</B> happy.<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> H843 (Asherites), H835 (blessed), H838 (going), H842 (grove), H837 (happy), H836 (Asher), H833 (bless), H839 (Ashurite), H8391 (box)<BR><B>Greek Equivalents:</B> G3107 μακάριος",
