    2161: "זָמַם (zâmam | zaw-mam')<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> a primitive root<BR><B>Strong's:</B> to plan, usually in a bad sense<BR><B>KJV:</B> consider, devise, imagine, plot, purpose, think (evil).<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> H4209 (device), H2155 (Zimmah), H2157 (Zamzummim), H2162 (wicked device), H2161 (consider), H2154 (heinous crime)<BR><B>Greek Equivalents:</B> G1011 βουλεύω, G1260 διαλογίζομαι, G1614 ἐκτείνω, G1760 ἐνθυμέομαι, G2007 ἐπιτίθημι, G2334 θεωρέω, G3906 παρατηρέω, G5550 χρόνος",
