    2172: "זִמְרָה (zimrâh | zim-raw')<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> from H2167 זָמַר<BR><B>Strong's:</B> a musical piece or song to be accompanied by an instrument<BR><B>KJV:</B> melody, psalm.<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> H2172 (melody), H4210 (psalm), H2158 (psalm), H2176 (song), H2167 (give praise)<BR><B>Greek Equivalents:</B> G133 αἴνεσις, G2590 καρπός",
