    2183: "זָנוּן (zânûwn | zaw-noon')<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> from H2181 זָנָה<BR><B>Strong's:</B> adultery; figuratively, idolatry<BR><B>KJV:</B> whoredom.<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> H2183 (whoredom), H2181 (commit fornication), H8457 (fornication), H2185 (armour), H2184 (whoredom)<BR><B>Greek Equivalents:</B> G4202 πορνεία",
