    2719: "חֶרֶב (chereb | kheh'-reb)<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> from H2717 חָרַב<BR><B>Strong's:</B> drought; also a cutting instrument (from its destructive effect), as a knife, sword, or other sharp implement<BR><B>KJV:</B> axe, dagger, knife, mattock, sword, tool.<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> H2717 (decay), H2726 (Harbona), H2719 (axe)<BR><B>Greek Equivalents:</B> G32 ἄγγελος, G3057 λόγχη, G3162 μάχαιρα, G4171 πόλεμος, G4501 ῥομφαία, G4604 σίδηρος, G4967 σφαγή, G5408 φόνος",
