    2732: "חֲרָדָה (Chărâdâh | khar-aw-daw')<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> the same as H2731 חֲרָדָה<BR><B>Strong's:</B> Charadah, a place in the Desert<BR><B>KJV:</B> Haradah.<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> H2733 (Harodite), H5878 (well of Harod), H2731 (care), H2730 (afraid), H2729 (be afraid), H2732 (Haradah)",
