    2737: "חָרוּז (chârûwz | khaw-rooz')<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> from an unused root meaning to perforate<BR><B>Strong's:</B> properly, pierced, i.e. a bead of pearl, gems or jewels (as strung)<BR><B>KJV:</B> chain.<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> H2737 (chain), H2745 (Harhas), H2736 (Harhaiah)",
