    2752: "חֹרִי (Chôrîy | kho-ree')<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> from H2356 חֹור ; cave-dweller or troglodyte<BR><B>Strong's:</B> a Chorite or aboriginal Idumaean<BR><B>KJV:</B> Horims, Horites.<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> H2356 (cave), H2352 (hole), H2752 (Horims), H2753 (Hori)",
