    2895: "טֹוב (ṭôwb | tobe)<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> a primitive root,<BR><B>Strong's:</B> to be (transitively, do or make) good (or well) in the widest sense<BR><B>KJV:</B> be (do) better, cheer, be (do, seem) good, (make) goodly, [idiom] please, (be, do, go, play) well.<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> H2900 (Tobiah), H2897 (Tob), H2896 (beautiful), H2899 (Tob-adonijah), H2898 (fair), H2895 (be better)<BR><B>Greek Equivalents:</B> G700 ἀρέσκω, G1013 βούλημα, G1380 δοκέω, G1653 ἐλεέω, G2573 καλῶς, G4851 συμφέρω",
