    2897: "טֹוב (Ṭôwb | tobe)<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> the same as H2896 טֹוב ; good<BR><B>Strong's:</B> Tob, a region apparently East of the Jordan<BR><B>KJV:</B> Tob.<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> H2900 (Tobiah), H2897 (Tob), H2896 (beautiful), H2899 (Tob-adonijah), H2898 (fair), H2895 (be better)",
