    2900: "טֹובִיָּה (Ṭôwbîyâh | to-bee-yaw')<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> or טֹובִיָּהוּ; from H2896 טֹוב and H3050 יָהּ; goodness of Jehovah<BR><B>Strong's:</B> Tobijah, the name of three Israelites and of one Samaritan<BR><B>KJV:</B> Tobiah, Tobijah.<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> H2900 (Tobiah), H2897 (Tob), H2896 (beautiful), H2899 (Tob-adonijah), H2898 (fair), H2895 (be better)",
