    2926: "טָלַל (ṭâlal | taw-lal')<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> a primitive root<BR><B>Strong's:</B> properly, to strew over, i.e. (by implication) to cover in or plate (with beams)<BR><B>KJV:</B> cover.<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> H2926 (cover)<BR><B>Greek Equivalents:</B> G538 ἀπατάω, G1818 ἐξαπατάω, G3884 παραλογίζομαι, G4105 πλανάω",
    2927: "טְלַל (ṭᵉlal | tel-al')<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> (Aramaic) corresponding to H2926 טָלַל<BR><B>Strong's:</B> to cover with shade<BR><B>KJV:</B> have a shadow.<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> H2877 (guard), H2920 (dew), H2869 (fine), H2908 (fasting), H2906 (mountain), H2927 (have a shadow), H2868 (be glad), H2917 (miry)<BR><B>Greek Equivalents:</B> G2681 κατασκηνόω",
