    2941: "טַעַם (ṭaʻam | tah'-am)<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> (Aramaic) from H2939 טְעַם ; compare H2940 טַעַם)<BR><BR><B>Strong's:</B> properly, a taste, i.e. ajudicial sentence<BR><B>KJV:</B> account, [idiom] to be commanded, commandment, matter.<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> H2953 (nail), H2941 (account), H2939 (make to eat), H2942 (chancellor)",
