    3548: "כֹּהֵן (kôhên | ko-hane')<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> active participle of H3547 כָּהַן<BR><B>Strong's:</B> literally one officiating, a priest; also (by courtesy) an acting priest (although a layman)<BR><B>KJV:</B> chief ruler, [idiom] own, priest, prince, principal officer.<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> H3547 (deck), H3553 (helmet), H3552 (Chub), H3548 (chief ruler), H3550 (priesthood)",
    3549: "כָּהֵן (kâhên | kaw-hane')<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> (Aramaic) corresponding to H3548 כֹּהֵן<BR><B>Strong's:</B> one officiating, a priest; also (by courtesy) an acting priest (although a layman)<BR><B>KJV:</B> priest.<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> H3567 (Cyrus), H3549 (priest), H3546 (be able), H3734 (cor), H3551 (window)<BR><B>Greek Equivalents:</B> G2409 ἱερεύς",
    3550: "כְּהֻנָּה (kᵉhunnâh | keh-hoon-naw')<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> from H3547 כָּהַן<BR><B>Strong's:</B> priesthood<BR><B>KJV:</B> priesthood, priest's office.<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> H3547 (deck), H3553 (helmet), H3552 (Chub), H3548 (chief ruler), H3550 (priesthood)<BR><B>Greek Equivalents:</B> G2405 ἱερατεία",
    3551: "כַּו (kav | kav)<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> (Aramaic) from a root corresponding to H3854 לַהַג in the sense of piercing<BR><B>Strong's:</B> a window (as a perforation)<BR><B>KJV:</B> window.<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> H3567 (Cyrus), H3549 (priest), H3546 (be able), H3734 (cor), H3551 (window)<BR><B>Greek Equivalents:</B> G2376 θυρίς",
    3552: "כּוּב (Kûwb | koob)<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> of foreign derivation<BR><B>Strong's:</B> Kub, a country near Egypt<BR><B>KJV:</B> Chub.<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> H3547 (deck), H3553 (helmet), H3552 (Chub), H3548 (chief ruler), H3550 (priesthood)",
