    3673: "כָּנַשׁ (kânash | kaw-nash')<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> (Aramaic) corresponding to H3664 כָּנַס<BR><B>Strong's:</B> to assemble<BR><B>KJV:</B> gather together.<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> H3673 (gather together), H3675 (companion)",
