    3723: "כָּפָר (kâphâr | kaw-fawr')<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> from H3722 כָּפַר<BR><B>Strong's:</B> a village (as protected by walls)<BR><B>KJV:</B> village. Compare H3715 כְּפִיר .<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> H3724 (bribe), H3715 (lion), H3726 (Chefarhaamonai), H3716 (Chephirah), H3723 (village)<BR><B>Greek Equivalents:</B> G2436 ἵλεως, G2968 κώμη, G2584 Καπερναούμ",
