    3763: "כְּרָן (Kᵉrân | ker-awn')<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> of uncertain derivation<BR><B>Strong's:</B> Keran, an aboriginal Idumaean<BR><B>KJV:</B> Cheran.<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> H3759 (full ears), H3761 (Carmelite), H3754 (vines), H3762 (Carmelitess), H3763 (Cheran), H3760 (Carmel), H3756 (Carmi), H3757 (Carmites), H3758 (crimson), H3755 (vine dresser)",
    3764: "כׇּרְסֵא (korçêʼ | kor-say')<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> (Aramaic) corresponding to H3678 כִּסֵּא<BR><B>Strong's:</B> a throne<BR><B>KJV:</B> throne.<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> H3702 (money), H3764 (throne)<BR><B>Greek Equivalents:</B> G2362 θρόνος",
    3765: "כִּרְסֵם (kirçêm | kir-same')<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> from H3697 כָּסַם<BR><B>Strong's:</B> to lay waste<BR><B>KJV:</B> waste.<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> H3697 ([idiom] only), H3698 (fitches), H3765 (waste)<BR><B>Greek Equivalents:</B> G3075 λυμαίνομαι",
