    3888: "לוּשׁ (lûwsh | loosh)<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> a primitive root<BR><B>Strong's:</B> to knead<BR><B>KJV:</B> knead.<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> H3888 (knead)",
    3889: "לוּשׁ (Lûwsh | loosh)<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> from H3888 לוּשׁ ; kneading<BR><B>Strong's:</B> Lush, a place in Palestine<BR><B>KJV:</B> Laish (from the margin). Compare H3919 לַיִשׁ .<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> H3919 (Laish), H3889 (Laish), H3918 (lion)",
