    3899: "לֶחֶם (lechem | lekh'-em)<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> from H3898 לָחַם ; See also H1036 בֵּית לְעַפְרָה<BR><B>Strong's:</B> food (for man or beast), especially bread, or grain (for making it)<BR><B>KJV:</B> (shew-) bread, [idiom] eat, food, fruit, loaf, meat, victuals.<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> H3902 (Lahmi), H3898 (devour), H3903 (Lahmam), H3899 (bread)<BR><B>Greek Equivalents:</B> G712 ἄριστον, G740 ἄρτος, G979 βίος, G1163 δεῖ, G1173 δεῖπνον, G1403 δοχή, G1435 δῶρον, G2222 ζωή, G3145 μασσάομαι, G4621 σῖτος, G4621 σῖτος, G5132 τράπεζα, G5160 τροφή",
    3900: "לְחֶם (lᵉchem | lekh-em')<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> (Aramaic) corresponding to H3899 לֶחֶם<BR><B>Strong's:</B> (for man or beast), especially bread, or grain (for making it)<BR><B>KJV:</B> feast.<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> H3904 (concubine), H3861 (but), H3916 (night), H3900 (feast), H3879 (Levite), H3961 (language), H3890 ([idiom] thee)",
    3901: "לָחֶם (lâchem | law-khem')<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> from H3898 לָחַם,<BR><B>Strong's:</B> battle<BR><B>KJV:</B> war.<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> H3901 (war), H3898 (devour), H4421 (battle), H3894 (while)",
    3902: "לַחְמִי (Lachmîy | lakh-mee')<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> from H3899 לֶחֶם ; foodful; (or perhaps erroneous transcription) for H1022 בֵּית הַלַּחְמִי<BR><B>Strong's:</B> Lachmi, an Israelite; or rather probably a brief form<BR><B>KJV:</B> Lahmi. See also H3433 יָשֻׁבִי לֶחֶם .<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> H3902 (Lahmi), H3898 (devour), H3903 (Lahmam), H3899 (bread)",
    3903: "לַחְמָס (Lachmâç | lakh-maws')<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> probably by erroneous transcription for לַחְמָם; from H3899 לֶחֶם ; food-like<BR><B>Strong's:</B> Lachmam or Lachmas, a place in Palestine<BR><B>KJV:</B> Lahmam.<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> H3902 (Lahmi), H3898 (devour), H3903 (Lahmam), H3899 (bread)",
