    3911: "לְטָאָה (lᵉṭâʼâh | let-aw-aw')<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> from an unused root meaning to hide<BR><B>Strong's:</B> a kind of lizard (from its covert habits)<BR><B>KJV:</B> lizard.<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> H3911 (lizard)",
