    3918: "לַיִשׁ (layish | lah'-yish)<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> from H3888 לוּשׁ in the sense of crushing<BR><B>Strong's:</B> a lion (from his destructive blows)<BR><B>KJV:</B> (old) lion.<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> H3919 (Laish), H3889 (Laish), H3918 (lion)",
