    4415: "מְלַח (mᵉlach | mel-akh')<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> (Aramaic) corresponding to H4414 מָלַח<BR><B>Strong's:</B> to eat salt, i.e. (generally) subsist<BR><B>KJV:</B> [phrase] have maintenance.<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> H4416 (maintenance), H4415 (have maintenance)",
