    4421: "מִלְחָמָה (milchâmâh | mil-khaw-maw')<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> from H3898 לָחַם (in the sense of fighting)<BR><B>Strong's:</B> a battle (i.e. the engagement); generally, war (i.e. warfare)<BR><B>KJV:</B> battle, fight(-ing), war(-rior).<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> H3901 (war), H3898 (devour), H4421 (battle), H3894 (while)<BR><B>Greek Equivalents:</B> G121 ἄθωος, G1411 δύναμις, G2372 θυμός, G3163 μάχη, G4171 πόλεμος",
