    5028: "נְבָט (Nᵉbâṭ | neb-awt')<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> from H5027 נָבַט ; regard<BR><B>Strong's:</B> Nebat, the father of Jeroboam I<BR><B>KJV:</B> Nebat.<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> H5027 (behold), H5032 (Nebaioth), H4007 (expectation), H5028 (Nebat), H5033 (spring)",
    5029: "נְבִיא (nᵉbîyʼ | neb-ee')<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> (Aramaic) corresponding to H5030 נָבִיא<BR><B>Strong's:</B> a prophet<BR><B>KJV:</B> prophet.<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> H5023 (reward), H5013 (prophesy), H5017 (prophesying), H5020 (Nebuchadnezzar), H5043 (candlestick), H5029 (prophet)<BR><B>Greek Equivalents:</B> G921 Βαρνάβας",
    5030: "נָבִיא (nâbîyʼ | naw-bee')<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> from H5012 נָבָא<BR><B>Strong's:</B> a prophet or (generally) inspired man<BR><B>KJV:</B> prophecy, that prophesy, prophet.<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> H5030 (prophecy), H5031 (prophetess), H5016 (prophecy), H5012 (prophesy)<BR><B>Greek Equivalents:</B> G5578 ψευδοπροφήτης",
