    5143: "נֵזֶק (nêzeq | nay'zek)<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> from an unused root meaning to injure<BR><B>Strong's:</B> loss<BR><B>KJV:</B> damage.<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> H5143 (damage), H5141 (earring)",
