    5237: "נׇכְרִי (nokrîy | nok-ree')<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> from H5235 נֶכֶר (second form)<BR><B>Strong's:</B> strange, in a variety of degrees and applications (foreign, non-relative, adulterous, different, wonderful)<BR><B>KJV:</B> alien, foreigner, outlandish, strange(-r, woman).<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> H5235 (strange), H5234 (acknowledge), H5237 (alien), H5238 (precious things), H5236 (alien)<BR><B>Greek Equivalents:</B> G2398 ἴδιος, G3581 ξένος",
    5238: "נְכֹת (nᵉkôth | nek-oth')<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> probably for H5219 נְכֹאת<BR><B>Strong's:</B> spicery, i.e. (generally) valuables<BR><B>KJV:</B> precious things.<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> H5235 (strange), H5234 (acknowledge), H5237 (alien), H5238 (precious things), H5236 (alien)<BR><B>Greek Equivalents:</B> G2368 θυμίαμα",
    5239: "נָלָה (nâlâh | naw-law')<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> apparently a primitive root<BR><B>Strong's:</B> to complete<BR><B>KJV:</B> make an end.<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> H5239 (make an end), H5241 (Nemuel), H5242 (Nemuelite), H4512 (perfection)<BR><B>Greek Equivalents:</B> G3708 ὁράω",
    5240: "נְמִבְזֶה (nᵉmibzeh | nem-ib-zeh')<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> from H959 בָּזָה,<BR><B>Strong's:</B> despised<BR><B>KJV:</B> vile.<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> H960 (despise), H959 (despise), H963 (contempt), H5240 (vile)",
    5241: "נְמוּאֵל (Nᵉmûwʼêl | nem-oo-ale')<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> apparently for H3223 יְמוּאֵל<BR><B>Strong's:</B> Nemuel, the name of two Israelites<BR><B>KJV:</B> Nemuel.<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> H5239 (make an end), H5241 (Nemuel), H5242 (Nemuelite), H4512 (perfection)",
