    5276: "נָעֵם (nâʻêm | naw-ame')<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> a primitive root<BR><B>Strong's:</B> to be agreeable (literally or figuratively)<BR><B>KJV:</B> pass in beauty, be delight, be pleasant, be sweet.<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> H5282 (pleasant), H5280 (Naamites), H5273 (pleasant), H5278 (beauty), H5276 (pass in beauty), H5283 (Naaman), H5284 (Naamathite), H4516 (dainty), H5281 (Naomi), H5277 (Naam), H5279 (Naamah)<BR><B>Greek Equivalents:</B> G957 βελτίον, G2234 ἡδέως, G2570 καλός, G2908 κρεῖσσον, G2909 κρείττων",
    5277: "נַעַם (Naʻam | nah'-am)<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> from H5276 נָעֵם ; pleasure<BR><B>Strong's:</B> Naam, an Israelite<BR><B>KJV:</B> Naam.<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> H5282 (pleasant), H5280 (Naamites), H5273 (pleasant), H5278 (beauty), H5276 (pass in beauty), H5283 (Naaman), H5284 (Naamathite), H4516 (dainty), H5281 (Naomi), H5277 (Naam), H5279 (Naamah)",
    5278: "נֹעַם (nôʻam | no'-am)<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> from H5276 נָעֵם<BR><B>Strong's:</B> agreeableness, i.e. delight, suitableness, splendor or grace<BR><B>KJV:</B> beauty, pleasant(-ness).<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> H5282 (pleasant), H5280 (Naamites), H5273 (pleasant), H5278 (beauty), H5276 (pass in beauty), H5283 (Naaman), H5284 (Naamathite), H4516 (dainty), H5281 (Naomi), H5277 (Naam), H5279 (Naamah)<BR><B>Greek Equivalents:</B> G2987 λαμπρότης, G4586 σεμνός",
