    5528: "סָכַל (çâkal | saw-kal')<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> for H3688 כָּסַל<BR><B>Strong's:</B> to be silly<BR><B>KJV:</B> do (make, play the, turn into) fool(-ish, -ishly, -ishness).<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> H5531 (folly), H5528 (do fool), H5529 (folly), H5530 (fool)",
