    5535: "סָכַת (çâkath | saw-kath')<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> a primitive root to be silent<BR><B>Strong's:</B> by implication, to observe quietly<BR><B>KJV:</B> take heed.<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> H5538 (Silla), H5535 (take heed)<BR><B>Greek Equivalents:</B> G4623 σιωπάω",
