    5543: "סַלּוּ (Çallûw | sal-loo')<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> or סַלּוּא; or סָלוּא; or סַלַּי; from H5541 סָלָה ; weighed<BR><B>Strong's:</B> Sallu or Sallai, the name of two Israelites<BR><B>KJV:</B> Sallai, Sallu, Salu.<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> H1354 (back), H1373 (Gabbai), H1359 (Gob), H5543 (Sallai), H1405 (Gibbethon)",
