    5701: "עָגַם (ʻâgam | aw-gam')<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> a primitive root<BR><B>Strong's:</B> to be sad<BR><B>KJV:</B> grieve.<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> H5701 (grieve)<BR><B>Greek Equivalents:</B> G3076 λυπέω, G4727 στενάζω",
