    6441: "פְּנִימָה (pᵉnîymâh | pen-ee'-maw)<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> from H6440 פָּנִים with directive enclitic<BR><B>Strong's:</B> faceward, i.e. indoors<BR><B>KJV:</B> (with-) in(-ner part, -ward).<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> H3312 (Jephunneh), H6437 (appear), H6441 (inner), H3942 (before), H6442 (inner), H6440 (accept), H6439 (Peniel)<BR><B>Greek Equivalents:</B> G2080 ἔσω, G4383 πρόσωπον",
