    6443: "פָּנִין (pânîyn | paw-neen')<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> or פָּנִי; from the same as H6434 פֵּן<BR><B>Strong's:</B> probably a pearl (as round)<BR><B>KJV:</B> ruby.<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> H6434 (corner), H6443 (ruby), H6444 (Peninnah), H6438 (bulwark)<BR><B>Greek Equivalents:</B> G3037 λίθος, G3037 λίθος, G4185 πολυτελής",
