    6446: "פַּס (paç | pas)<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> from H6461 פָּסַס ; properly, the palm (of the hand) or sole (of the foot) (compare H6447 פַּס); by implication (plural)<BR><BR><B>Strong's:</B> a long and sleeved tunic (perhaps simply a wide one; from the original sense of the root, i.e. of many breadths)<BR><B>KJV:</B> (divers) colours.<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> H6446 (colours), H6451 (handful)",
