    7122: "קָרָא (qârâʼ | kaw-raw')<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> a primitive root<BR><B>Strong's:</B> to encounter, whether accidentally or in a hostile manner<BR><B>KJV:</B> befall, (by) chance, (cause to) come (upon), fall out, happen, meet.<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> H7125 ([idiom] against), H7122 (befall)",
