    7435: "רָמָתִי (Râmâthîy | raw-maw-thee')<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> patronymic of H7414 רָמָה<BR><B>Strong's:</B> a Ramathite or inhabitant of Ramah<BR><B>KJV:</B> Ramathite.<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> H7312 (haughtiness), H7315 (on high), H7433 (Ramoth-gilead), H7419 (height), H8641 (gift), H7410 (Ram), H7216 (Ramoth), H7318 (be extolled), H7413 (high place), H7319 (high), H7437 (Ramath-lehi), H7414 (Ramah), H4791 (above), H8642 (oblation), H7418 (south Ramoth), H7432 (Remeth), H7427 (lifting up of self), H7435 (Ramathite), H7320 (Romamti-ezer), H7317 (haughtily), H7434 (Ramath-mizpeh), H7316 (Rumah), H7311 (bring up)",
