    7443: "רֶנֶן (renen | reh'-nen)<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> from H7442 רָנַן<BR><B>Strong's:</B> an ostrich (from its wail)<BR><B>KJV:</B> [idiom] goodly.<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> H7446 (Rissah), H7444 (singing), H7441 (Rinnah), H7445 (joyful), H7443 ([idiom] goodly), H7442 (aloud for joy), H7440 (cry), H7438 (song)",
    7444: "רַנֵּן (rannên | ran-nane')<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> intensive from H7442 רָנַן<BR><B>Strong's:</B> shouting (for joy)<BR><B>KJV:</B> singing.<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> H7446 (Rissah), H7444 (singing), H7441 (Rinnah), H7445 (joyful), H7443 ([idiom] goodly), H7442 (aloud for joy), H7440 (cry), H7438 (song)",
