    7599: "שָׁאַן (shâʼan | shaw-an')<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> a primitive root<BR><B>Strong's:</B> to loll, i.e. be peaceful<BR><B>KJV:</B> be at ease, be quiet, rest. See also H1052 בֵּית שְׁאָן .<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> H7599 (be at ease), H7600 (that is at ease)<BR><B>Greek Equivalents:</B> G373 ἀναπαύω, G3973 παύω",
