    7679: "שָׂגָא (sâgâʼ | saw-gaw')<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> ; a primitive root<BR><B>Strong's:</B> to grow, i.e. (causatively) to enlarge, (figuratively) laud<BR><B>KJV:</B> increase, magnify.<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> H7685 (grow), H7679 (increase), H7689 (excellent)<BR><B>Greek Equivalents:</B> G3173 μέγας, G5312 ὑψόω",
