    7690: "שַׂגִּיא (saggîyʼ | sag-ghee')<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> (Aramaic) corresponding to H7689 שַׂגִּיא<BR><B>Strong's:</B> large (in size, quantity or number, also adverbial)<BR><B>KJV:</B> exceeding, great(-ly); many, much, sore, very.<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> H7680 (grow), H3026 (Jegar-Sahadutha), H7690 (exceeding)<BR><B>Greek Equivalents:</B> G3173 μέγας, G4970 σφόδρα",
