    7694: "שֵׁגָל (shêgâl | shay-gawl')<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> from H7693 שָׁגַל<BR><B>Strong's:</B> a queen (from cohabitation)<BR><B>KJV:</B> queen.<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> H7693 (lie with), H7694 (queen)<BR><B>Greek Equivalents:</B> G938 βασίλισσα",
