    7698: "שֶׁגֶר (sheger | sheh'-ger)<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> from an unused root probably meaning to eject<BR><B>Strong's:</B> the fetus (as finally expelled)<BR><B>KJV:</B> that cometh of, increase.<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> H7698 (that cometh of), H7700 (devil)<BR><B>Greek Equivalents:</B> G3388 μήτρα",
