    7707: "שְׁדֵיאוּר (Shᵉdêyʼûwr | shed-ay-oor')<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> from the same as H7704 שָׂדֶה and H217 אוּר ; spreader of light<BR><B>Strong's:</B> Shedejur, an Israelite<BR><B>KJV:</B> Shedeur.<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> H7706 (Almighty), H7707 (Shedeur), H7705 ([idiom] all sorts), H7699 (breast)",
