    7714: "שַׁדְרַךְ (Shadrak | shad-rak')<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> probably of foreign origin<BR><B>Strong's:</B> Shadrak, the Babylonian name of one of Daniel's companions<BR><B>KJV:</B> Shadrach.<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> H7714 (Shadrach), H7711 (blasted), H7710 (blast)",
