    7895: "שִׁישַׁק (Shîyshaq | shee-shak')<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> or שׁוּשַׁק; of Egyptian derivation<BR><B>Strong's:</B> Shishak, an Egyptian king<BR><B>KJV:</B> Shishak.<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> H8336 ([idiom] blue), H7893 (white), H7895 (Shishak), H7894 (Shisha)",
