    7903: "שְׁכֹבֶת (shᵉkôbeth | shek-o'-beth)<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> from H7901 שָׁכַב<BR><B>Strong's:</B> a (sexual) lying with<BR><B>KJV:</B> [idiom] lie.<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> H7902 ([idiom] carnally), H7901 ([idiom] at all), H7903 ([idiom] lie), H4904 (bed)",
    7904: "שָׁכָה (shâkâh | shaw-kaw')<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> a primitive root<BR><B>Strong's:</B> to roam (through lust)<BR><B>KJV:</B> in the morning (by mistake for H7925 שָׁכַם).<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> H7904 (in the morning)",
