    7907: "שֶׂכְוִי (sekvîy | sek-vee')<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> from the same as H7906 שֵׂכוּ<BR><B>Strong's:</B> observant, i.e. (concretely) the mind<BR><B>KJV:</B> heart.<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> H7914 (picture), H7907 (heart), H4906 (conceit), H7906 (Sechu), H7634 (Shachia), H7915 (knife)",
    7908: "שְׁכֹול (shᵉkôwl | shek-ole')<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> infinitive of H7921 שָׁכֹל<BR><B>Strong's:</B> bereavement<BR><B>KJV:</B> loss of children, spoiling.<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> H7909 (barren), H7921 (bereave), H7908 (loss of children), H7923 (to have after loss of others)",
