    7927: "שְׁכֶם (Shᵉkem | shek-em')<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> the same as H7926 שְׁכֶם ; ridge<BR><B>Strong's:</B> Shekem, a place in Palestine<BR><B>KJV:</B> Shechem.<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> H7929 (shoulder blade), H7925 (early), H7927 (Shechem), H7930 (Shichemites), H7926 (back), H7928 (Shechem)<BR><B>Greek Equivalents:</B> G4966 Συχέμ",
    7928: "שֶׁכֶם (Shekem | sheh'-kem)<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> for H7926 שְׁכֶם<BR><B>Strong's:</B> Shekem, the name of a Hivite and two Israelites<BR><B>KJV:</B> Shechem.<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> H7929 (shoulder blade), H7925 (early), H7927 (Shechem), H7930 (Shichemites), H7926 (back), H7928 (Shechem)",
    7929: "שִׁכְמָה (shikmâh | shik-maw')<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> feminine of H7926 שְׁכֶם<BR><B>Strong's:</B> the shoulderbone<BR><B>KJV:</B> shoulder blade.<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> H7929 (shoulder blade), H7925 (early), H7927 (Shechem), H7930 (Shichemites), H7926 (back), H7928 (Shechem)<BR><B>Greek Equivalents:</B> G2807 κλείς",
    7930: "שִׁכְמִי (Shikmîy | shik-mee')<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> patronymic from H7928 שֶׁכֶם<BR><B>Strong's:</B> a Shikmite (collectively), or descendants of Shekem<BR><B>KJV:</B> Shichemites.<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> H7929 (shoulder blade), H7925 (early), H7927 (Shechem), H7930 (Shichemites), H7926 (back), H7928 (Shechem)",
