    7949: "שָׁלַג (shâlag | shaw-lag')<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> a primitive root; properly, meaning to be white; used only as denominative from H7950 שֶׁלֶג<BR><B>Strong's:</B> to be snow-white (with the linen clothing of the slain)<BR><B>KJV:</B> be as snow.<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> H7950 (snow), H7949 (be as snow)",
