    7953: "שָׁלָה (shâlâh | shaw-law')<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> a primitive root (rather cognate (by contraction) to the base of H5394 נָשַׁל, H7997 שָׁלַל and their congeners through the idea of extracting)<BR><B>Strong's:</B> to draw out or off, i.e. remove (the soul by death)<BR><B>KJV:</B> take away.<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> H8023 (Shiloni), H7988 (young one), H7887 (Shiloh), H7953 (take away), H7888 (Shilonite)<BR><B>Greek Equivalents:</B> G1257 διαλείπω, G4105 πλανάω",
