    8420: "תָּו (tâv | tawv)<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> from H8427 תָּוָה<BR><B>Strong's:</B> a mark; by implication, a signature<BR><B>KJV:</B> desire, mark.<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> H8379 (utmost bound), H8427 (scrabble), H8420 (desire)<BR><B>Greek Equivalents:</B> G2513 καθαρός, G4592 σημεῖον, G5495 χείρ",
