    8422: "תּוּבַל (Tûwbal | too-bal')<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> or תֻּבַל; probably of foreign derivation<BR><B>Strong's:</B> Tubal, a postdiluvian patriarch and his posterity<BR><B>KJV:</B> Tubal.<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> H8415 (deep), H8422 (Tubal), H8423 (Tubal-cain)",
    8423: "תּוּבַל קַיִן (Tûwbal Qayin | too-bal' kah'-yin)<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> apparently from H2986 יָבַל (compare H2981 יְבוּל) and H7014 קַיִן ; offspring of Cain<BR><B>Strong's:</B> Tubal-Kajin, an antidiluvian patriarch<BR><B>KJV:</B> Tubal-cain.<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> H8415 (deep), H8422 (Tubal), H8423 (Tubal-cain)",
    8424: "תּוּגָה (tûwgâh | too-gaw')<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> from H3013 יָגָה<BR><B>Strong's:</B> depression (of spirits); concretely a grief<BR><B>KJV:</B> heaviness, sorrow.<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> H3013 (afflict), H8424 (heaviness), H3015 (grief)<BR><B>Greek Equivalents:</B> G3077 λύπη, G3601 ὀδύνη, G3997 πένθος",
    8425: "תֹּוגַרְמָה (Tôwgarmâh | to-gar-maw')<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> or תֹּגַרְמָה; probably of foreign derivation<BR><B>Strong's:</B> Togarmah, a son of Gomer and his posterity<BR><B>KJV:</B> Togarmah.<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> H8402 (Tibni), H8405 (Thebez), H8413 (Tidal), H8407 (Tiglath-pileser), H8412 (Tadmor), H4963 (straw), H8401 (chaff), H8425 (Togarmah)",
    8426: "תֹּודָה (tôwdâh | to-daw')<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> from H3034 יָדָה<BR><B>Strong's:</B> properly, an extension of the hand, i.e. (by implication) avowal, or (usually) adoration; specifically, a choir of worshippers<BR><B>KJV:</B> confession, (sacrifice of) praise, thanks(-giving, offering).<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> H1939 (Hodaiah), H8426 (confession), H3044 (Jidlaph), H3034 (cast), H3038 (Jeduthun), H1960 (thanksgiving), H3042 (Jedaiah), H1938 (Hodaviah)<BR><B>Greek Equivalents:</B> G103 ᾄδω, G133 αἴνεσις, G1435 δῶρον",
    8427: "תָּוָה (tâvâh | taw-vaw')<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> a primitive root<BR><B>Strong's:</B> to mark out, i.e. (primitive) scratch or (definite) imprint<BR><B>KJV:</B> scrabble, set (a mark).<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> H8379 (utmost bound), H8427 (scrabble), H8420 (desire)<BR><B>Greek Equivalents:</B> G3947 παροξύνω, G5178 τυμπανίζω",
    8428: "תָּוָה (tâvâh | taw-vaw')<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> a primitive root (or perhaps identical with H8427 תָּוָה through a similar idea from scraping to pieces)<BR><B>Strong's:</B> to grieve<BR><B>KJV:</B> limit (by confusion with H8427 תָּוָה).<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> H8437 (that wasted), H8428 (limit), H8432 (among), H8459 (Tohu), H8430 (Toah), H8484 (middle)",
