    8431: "תֹּוחֶלֶת (tôwcheleth | to-kheh'-leth)<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> from H3176 יָחַל<BR><B>Strong's:</B> expectation<BR><B>KJV:</B> hope.<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> H3178 (Jahleelites), H3176 (hope), H3177 (Jahleel), H8431 (hope), H3175 (should hope)<BR><B>Greek Equivalents:</B> G1680 ἐλπίς, G2745 καύχημα, G5287 ὑπόστασις",
    8432: "תָּוֶךְ (tâvek | taw'-vek)<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> from an unused root meaning to sever<BR><B>Strong's:</B> a bisection, i.e. (by implication) the centre<BR><B>KJV:</B> among(-st), [idiom] between, half, [idiom] (there-, where-), in(-to), middle, mid(-night), midst (among), [idiom] out (of), [idiom] through, [idiom] with(-in).<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> H8437 (that wasted), H8428 (limit), H8432 (among), H8459 (Tohu), H8430 (Toah), H8484 (middle)<BR><B>Greek Equivalents:</B> G1388 δόλος, G2873 κόπος, G3319 μέσος, G5009 ταμεῖον, G5110 τόκος",
    8433: "תֹּוכֵחָה (tôwkêchâh | to-kay-khaw')<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> and תֹּוכַחַת; from H3198 יָכַח<BR><B>Strong's:</B> chastisement; figuratively (by words) correction, refutation, proof (even in defence)<BR><B>KJV:</B> argument, [idiom] chastened, correction, reasoning, rebuke, reproof, [idiom] be (often) reproved.<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> H3198 (appoint), H8433 (argument)<BR><B>Greek Equivalents:</B> G1557 ἐκδίκησις, G1650 ἔλεγχος, G1650 ἔλεγχος, G1785 ἐντολή, G3680 ὀνειδισμός, G3809 παιδεία",
    8434: "תֹּולָד (Tôwlâd | to-lawd')<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> from H3205 יָלַד ; posterity<BR><B>Strong's:</B> Tolad, a place in Palestine<BR><B>KJV:</B> Tolad. Compare H513 אֶלְתֹּולַד .<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> H3206 (boy), H3205 (bear), H2056 (child), H8434 (Tolad), H4138 (begotten), H4137 (Moladah), H3209 (born), H3208 (childhood), H3207 (damsel), H4140 (Molid), H3211 (born), H8435 (birth), H3210 (Jalon)",
    8435: "תֹּולְדָה (tôwlᵉdâh | to-led-aw')<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> or תֹּלְדָה; from H3205 יָלַד<BR><B>Strong's:</B> (plural only) descent, i.e. family; (figuratively) history<BR><B>KJV:</B> birth, generations.<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> H3206 (boy), H3205 (bear), H2056 (child), H8434 (Tolad), H4138 (begotten), H4137 (Moladah), H3209 (born), H3208 (childhood), H3207 (damsel), H4140 (Molid), H3211 (born), H8435 (birth), H3210 (Jalon)<BR><B>Greek Equivalents:</B> G1078 γένεσις, G4772 συγγένεια",
    8436: "תּוּלֹון (Tûwlôwn | too-lone')<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> from H8524 תָּלַל ; suspension<BR><B>Strong's:</B> Tulon, an Israelite<BR><B>KJV:</B> Tilon (from the margin).<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> H8494 (Tiras), H8485 (Tema), H8491 (Tizite), H8436 (Tilon), H8481 (lower), H8478 (as), H8480 (Tahath), H8495 (he goat), H8482 (low)",
    8437: "תֹּולָל (tôwlâl | to-lawl')<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> from H3213 יָלַל<BR><B>Strong's:</B> causing to howl, i.e. an oppressor<BR><B>KJV:</B> that wasted.<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> H8437 (that wasted), H8428 (limit), H8432 (among), H8459 (Tohu), H8430 (Toah), H8484 (middle)",
