    8439: "תֹּולָע (Tôwlâʻ | to-law')<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> the same as H8438 תֹּולָע ; worm<BR><B>Strong's:</B> Tola, the name of two Israelites<BR><B>KJV:</B> Tola.<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> H8530 (armoury), H8439 (Tola), H4459 (great tooth), H4973 (cheek tooth), H8529 ([idiom] scarlet), H8438 (crimson), H8440 (Tolaites)<BR><B>Greek Equivalents:</B> G2847 κόκκινος",
