    8441: "תֹּועֵבַה (tôwʻêbah | to-ay-baw')<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> or תֹּעֵבַה; feminine active participle of H8581 תַּעָב<BR><B>Strong's:</B> properly, something disgusting (morally), i.e. (as noun) an abhorrence; especially idolatry or (concretely) an idol<BR><B>KJV:</B> abominable (custom, thing), abomination.<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> H8441 (abominable), H8374 (abhor), H8581 (abhor)<BR><B>Greek Equivalents:</B> G167 ἀκαθαρσία, G169 ἀκάθαρτος, G266 ἁμαρτία, G458 ἀνομία, G459 ἄνομος, G763 ἀσέβεια, G946 βδέλυγμα, G947 βδελυκτός, G2041 ἔργον, G4189 πονηρία, G4190 πονηρός, G4191 πονηρότερος",
    8442: "תֹּועָה (tôwʻâh | to-aw')<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> feminine active participle of H8582 תָּעָה<BR><B>Strong's:</B> mistake, i.e. (morally) impiety, or (political) injury<BR><B>KJV:</B> error, hinder.<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> H8583 (Toi), H8442 (error), H8590 (Taanach), H8582 (go astray)<BR><B>Greek Equivalents:</B> G4579 σείω",
    8443: "תֹּועָפָה (tôwʻâphâh | to-aw-faw')<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> from H3286 יָעַף<BR><B>Strong's:</B> (only in plural collective) weariness, i.e. (by implication) toil (treasure so obtained) or speed<BR><B>KJV:</B> plenty, strength.<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> H8443 (plenty)<BR><B>Greek Equivalents:</B> G1391 δόξα, G4448 πυρόω, G5311 ὕψος",
    8444: "תֹּוצָאָה (tôwtsâʼâh | to-tsaw-aw')<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> or תֹּצָאָה; from H3318 יָצָא<BR><B>Strong's:</B> (only in plural collective) exit, i.e. (geographical) boundary, or (figuratively) deliverance, (actively) source<BR><B>KJV:</B> border(-s), going(-s) forth (out), issues, outgoings.<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> H4161 (brought out), H6631 (that which cometh forth), H8444 (border), H4163 (draught house; going forth), H3329 (those that came forth), H3318 ([idiom] after), H4162 (Moza)<BR><B>Greek Equivalents:</B> G1327 διέξοδος",
