    8450: "תֹּור (tôwr | tore)<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> (Aramaic) corresponding (by permutation) to H7794 שֹׁור<BR><B>Strong's:</B> a bull<BR><B>KJV:</B> bullock, ox.<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> H8450 (bullock), H8460 (under), H8517 (snow), H8479 (under), H8429 (be astonied)",
