    8458: "תַּחְבֻּלָה (tachbulâh | takh-boo-law')<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> or תַּחְבּוּלָה; from H2254 חָבַל as denominative from H2256 חֶבֶל<BR><B>Strong's:</B> (only in plural) properly, steerage (as a management of ropes), i.e. (figuratively) guidance or (by implication) a plan<BR><B>KJV:</B> good advice, (wise) counsels.<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> H2260 (mast), H8458 (good advice), H2258 (pledge), H2254 ([idiom] at all), H2259 (pilot), H2256 (band)<BR><B>Greek Equivalents:</B> G1013 βούλημα, G2941 κυβέρνησις",
    8459: "תֹּחוּ (Tôchûw | to'-khoo)<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> from an unused root meaning to depress; abasement<BR><B>Strong's:</B> Tochu, an Israelite<BR><B>KJV:</B> Tohu.<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> H8437 (that wasted), H8428 (limit), H8432 (among), H8459 (Tohu), H8430 (Toah), H8484 (middle)",
