    100: "ἁδρότης (hadrótēs | had-rot'-ace)<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> from ἁδρός (stout)<BR><B>Strong's:</B> plumpness, i.e. (figuratively) liberality<BR><B>KJV:</B> abundance.<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> G1381 (allow), G1383 (trial), G1382 (experience), G1384 (approved), G96 (castaway)<BR><B>Variants:</B> ἁδρότης",
