    122: "αἴγειος (aígeios | ah'-ee-ghi-os)<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> from αἴξ (a goat)<BR><B>Strong's:</B> belonging to a goat<BR><B>KJV:</B> goat.<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> G118 (strive), G119 (fight), G4866 (labour with)<BR><B>Variants:</B> αἴγειος<BR><B>Hebrew Equivalents:</B> H5795 עֵז",
