    142: "αἴρω (aírō | ah'-ee-ro)<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> a primary root<BR><B>Strong's:</B> to lift up; by implication, to take up or away; figuratively, to raise (the voice), keep in suspense (the mind), specially, to sail away (i.e. weigh anchor); by Hebraism (compare H5375) to expiate sin<BR><B>KJV:</B> away with, bear (up), carry, lift up, loose, make to doubt, put away, remove, take (away, up).<BR><I>See:</I> H5375<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> G142 (away with), G1869 (exalt self)<BR><B>Variants:</B> αἴρω<BR><B>Hebrew Equivalents:</B> H622 אָסַף, H656 אָפֵס, H935 בֹּוא, H1504 גָּזַר, H1980 הָלַךְ, H2846 חָתָה, H2904 טוּל, H3426 יֵשׁ, H3447 יָשַׁט, H3947 לָקַח, H3988 מָאַס, H4853 מַשָּׂא, H5130 נוּף, H5186 נָטָה, H5190 נָטַל, H5375 נָשָׂא, H5375 נָשָׂא, H5375 נָשָׂא, H5493 סוּר, H5647 עָבַד, H5710 עָדָה, H5737 עֲדַר, H6004 עָמַם, H6006 עָמַס, H6186 עָרַךְ, H6565 פָּרַר, H6566 פָּרַשׂ, H7311 רוּם, H7673 שָׁבַת, H7843 שָׁחַת",
    143: "αἰσθάνομαι (aisthánomai | ahee-sthan'-om-ahee)<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> of uncertain derivation<BR><B>Strong's:</B> to apprehend (properly, by the senses)<BR><B>KJV:</B> perceive.<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> G144 (judgment), G143 (perceive), G145 (senses)<BR><B>Variants:</B> αἰσθάνομαι<BR><B>Hebrew Equivalents:</B> H995 בִּין, H2648 חָפַז, H3045 יָדַע",
