    148: "αἰσχρολογία (aischrología | ahee-skhrol-og-ee'-ah)<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> from G150 and G3056<BR><B>Strong's:</B> vile conversation<BR><B>KJV:</B> filthy communication.<BR><BR><I>See:</I> G150<BR><I>See:</I> G3056<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> G144 (judgment), G143 (perceive), G145 (senses)<BR><B>Variants:</B> αἰσχρολογία",
