    152: "αἰσχύνη (aischýnē | ahee-skhoo'-nay)<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> from G153<BR><B>Strong's:</B> shame or disgrace (abstractly or concretely)<BR><B>KJV:</B> dishonesty, shame.<BR><BR><I>See:</I> G153<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> G2617 (confound), G151 (filthiness), G1870 (be ashamed), G150 (filthy), G152 (dishonesty), G153 (be ashamed)<BR><B>Variants:</B> αἰσχύνη<BR><B>Hebrew Equivalents:</B> H954 בּוּשׁ, H1167 בַּעַל, H1322 בֹּשֶׁת, H1860 דְּרָאֹון, H1942 הַוָּה, H1971 הַכָּרָה, H2781 חֶרְפָּה, H3639 כְּלִמָּה, H4626 מַעַר, H6172 עֶרְוָה",
