    240: "ἀλλήλων (allḗlōn | al-lay'-lone)<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> Genitive plural from G243 reduplicated<BR><B>Strong's:</B> one another<BR><B>KJV:</B> each other, mutual, one another, (the other), (them-, your-)selves, (selves) together (sometimes with G3326 or G4314).<BR><BR><I>See:</I> G243<BR><I>See:</I> G3326<BR><I>See:</I> G4314<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> G239 (alleluiah)<BR><B>Variants:</B> ἀλλήλων",
