    256: "Ἀλφαῖος (Alphaîos | al-fah'-yos)<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> of Hebrew origin (compare H2501)<BR><B>Strong's:</B> Alphæus, an Israelite<BR><B>KJV:</B> Alpheus.<BR><I>See:</I> H2501<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> G253 (less sorrowful), G3077 (grief), G4036 (exceeding sorry), G4818 (be grieved), G3076 (cause grief)<BR><B>Variants:</B> Ἀλφαῖος, Ἁλφαῖος, Ἀλφαίος<BR><B>Hebrew Equivalents:</B> H2501 חֶלֶף",
