    260: "ἅμα (háma | ham'-ah)<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> a primary particle<BR><B>Strong's:</B> properly, at the \"same\" time, but freely used as a preposition or adverb denoting close association<BR><B>KJV:</B> also, and, together, with(-al).<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> G253 (less sorrowful), G3077 (grief), G4036 (exceeding sorry), G4818 (be grieved), G3076 (cause grief)<BR><B>Variants:</B> ἅμα",
