    302: "ἄν (án | an)<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> a primary particle, denoting a supposition, wish, possibility or uncertainty<BR><B>KJV:</B> (what-, where-, wither-, who-)soever. Usually unexpressed except by the subjunctive or potential mood. Also contracted for G1437 .<BR><BR><I>See:</I> G1437<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> G3470 (blemish), G299 (without blame), G298 (blameless), G3469 (blame)<BR><B>Variants:</B> ἄν",
