    841: "αὐτάρκεια (autárkeia | ow-tar'-ki-ah)<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> from G842<BR><B>Strong's:</B> self-satisfaction, i.e. (abstractly) contentedness, or (concretely) a competence<BR><B>KJV:</B> contentment, sufficiency.<BR><BR><I>See:</I> G842<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> G841 (contentment), G713 (enough), G842 (content), G714 (be content)<BR><B>Variants:</B> αὐτάρκεια",
