    1099: "γλυκύς (glykýs | gloo-koos')<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> of uncertain affinity<BR><B>Strong's:</B> sweet (i.e. not bitter nor salt)<BR><B>KJV:</B> sweet, fresh.<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> G1110 (acquaintance), G1097 (allow), G1106 (advice), G4268 (foreknowledge), G1922 (acknowledging), G4774 (permission), G4267 (foreknow), G1107 (certify), G1921 (acknowledge), G1108 (knowledge), G176 (that cannot be condemned), G2607 (blame)<BR><B>Variants:</B> γλυκύς<BR><B>Hebrew Equivalents:</B> H4452 מָלַץ, H4966 מָתֹוק",
