    1201: "δεσμωτήριον (desmōtḗrion | des-mo-tay'-ree-on)<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> from a derivative of G1199 (equivalent to G1196)<BR><B>Strong's:</B> a place of bondage, i.e. a dungeon<BR><B>KJV:</B> prison.<BR><BR><I>See:</I> G1199<BR><I>See:</I> G1196<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> G1199 (band), G1198 (in bonds)<BR><B>Variants:</B> δεσμωτήριον<BR><B>Hebrew Equivalents:</B> H615 אָסִיר, H1004 בַּיִת",
    1202: "δεσμώτης (desmṓtēs | des-mo'-tace)<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> from the same as G1201<BR><B>Strong's:</B> (passively) a captive<BR><B>KJV:</B> prisoner.<BR><BR><I>See:</I> G1201<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> G1199 (band), G1198 (in bonds)<BR><B>Variants:</B> δεσμώτης<BR><B>Hebrew Equivalents:</B> H631 אָסַר, H4525 מַסְגֵּר",
    1203: "δεσπότης (despótēs | des-pot'-ace)<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> perhaps from G1210 and πόσις (a husband)<BR><B>Strong's:</B> an absolute ruler (\"despot\")<BR><B>KJV:</B> Lord, master.<BR><BR><I>See:</I> G1210<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> G1203 (Lord), G3617 (goodman), G3616 (guide the house)<BR><B>Variants:</B> δεσπότης<BR><B>Hebrew Equivalents:</B> H113 אָדֹון, H136 אֲדֹנָי, H433 אֱלֹוהַּ, H3068 יְהֹוָה, H4911 מָשַׁל",
    1204: "δεῦρο (deûro | dyoo'-ro)<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> of uncertain affinity<BR><B>Strong's:</B> here; used also imperative hither!; and of time, hitherto<BR><B>KJV:</B> come (hither), hither(-to).<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> G1203 (Lord), G3617 (goodman), G3616 (guide the house)<BR><B>Variants:</B> δεῦρο<BR><B>Hebrew Equivalents:</B> H3212 יָלַךְ, H3212 יָלַךְ",
    1205: "δεῦτε (deûte | dyoo'-teh)<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> from G1204 and an imperative form of εἶμι (to go)<BR><B>Strong's:</B> come hither!<BR><B>KJV:</B> come, X follow.<BR><BR><I>See:</I> G1204<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> G1203 (Lord), G3617 (goodman), G3616 (guide the house)<BR><B>Variants:</B> δεῦτε<BR><B>Hebrew Equivalents:</B> H3212 יָלַךְ",
    1206: "δευτεραῖος (deuteraîos | dyoo-ter-ah'-yos)<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> from G1208<BR><B>Strong's:</B> secondary, i.e. (specially) on the second day<BR><B>KJV:</B> next day.<BR><BR><I>See:</I> G1208<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> G1203 (Lord), G3617 (goodman), G3616 (guide the house)<BR><B>Variants:</B> δευτεραῖος",
