    1212: "δῆλος (dēlos | day'-los)<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> of uncertain derivation<BR><B>Strong's:</B> clear<BR><B>KJV:</B> + bewray, certain, evident, manifest.<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> G1210 (bind)<BR><B>Variants:</B> δῆλος<BR><B>Hebrew Equivalents:</B> H217 אוּר, H8537 תֹּם, H8655 תְּרָפִים",
