    1215: "δημηγορέω (dēmēgoréō | day-may-gor-eh'-o)<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> from a compound of G1218 and G58<BR><B>Strong's:</B> to be a people-gatherer, i.e. to address a public assembly<BR><B>KJV:</B> make an oration.<BR><BR><I>See:</I> G1218<BR><I>See:</I> G58<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> G1213 (declare)<BR><B>Variants:</B> δημηγορέω",
