    1222: "δήπου (dḗpou | day'-poo)<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> from G1211 and G4225<BR><B>Strong's:</B> a particle of asseveration; indeed doubtless<BR><B>KJV:</B> verily.<BR><BR><I>See:</I> G1211<BR><I>See:</I> G4225<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> G3927 (pilgrim), G1218 (people), G1553 (be absent), G1736 (be at home)<BR><B>Variants:</B> δήπου",
