    2065: "ἐρωτάω (erōtáō | er-o-tah'-o)<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> apparently from G2046 (compare G2045)<BR><B>Strong's:</B> to interrogate; by implication, to request<BR><B>KJV:</B> ask, beseech, desire, intreat, pray. Compare G4441 .<BR><BR><I>See:</I> G2046<BR><I>See:</I> G2045<BR><I>See:</I> G4441<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> G1906 (answer), G1905 (ask), G2065 (ask)<BR><B>Variants:</B> ἐρωτάω<BR><B>Hebrew Equivalents:</B> H559 אָמַר, H2713 חָקַר, H7592 שָׁאַל",
