    2170: "εὐχάριστος (eucháristos | yoo-khar'-is-tos)<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> from G2095 and a derivative of G5483<BR><B>Strong's:</B> well favored, i.e. (by implication) grateful<BR><B>KJV:</B> thankful.<BR><BR><I>See:</I> G2095<BR><I>See:</I> G5483<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> G5479 (gladness), G4796 (rejoice in), G2168 (thank), G2169 (thankfulness), G5485 (acceptable), G5486 (gift), G5463 (farewell), G5484 (be- cause of), G2170 (thankful), G5487 (make accepted), G884 (unthankful), G5483 (deliver)<BR><B>Variants:</B> εὐχάριστος<BR><B>Hebrew Equivalents:</B> H2580 חֵן",
    2171: "εὐχή (euchḗ | yoo-khay')<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> from G2172<BR><B>Strong's:</B> properly, a wish, expressed as a petition to God, or in votive obligation<BR><B>KJV:</B> prayer, vow.<BR><BR><I>See:</I> G2172<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> G2172 (pray), G4335 (X pray earnestly), G4336 (pray), G2171 (prayer)<BR><B>Variants:</B> εὐχή<BR><B>Hebrew Equivalents:</B> H1259 בָּרָד, H5087 נָדַר, H5088 נֶדֶר, H5144 נָזַר, H8605 תְּפִלָּה",
