    2174: "εὐψυχέω (eupsychéō | yoo-psoo-kheh'-o)<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> from a compound of G2095 and G5590<BR><B>Strong's:</B> to be in good spirits, i.e. feel encouraged<BR><B>KJV:</B> be of good comfort.<BR><BR><I>See:</I> G2095<BR><I>See:</I> G5590<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> G2172 (pray), G4335 (X pray earnestly), G4336 (pray), G2171 (prayer)<BR><B>Variants:</B> εὐψυχέω",
