    2180: "Ἐφέσιος (Ephésios | ef-es'-ee-os)<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> from G2181<BR><B>Strong's:</B> an Ephesian or inhabitant of Ephesus<BR><B>KJV:</B> Ephesian, of Ephesus.<BR><BR><I>See:</I> G2181<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> G2178 (once), G530 (once)<BR><B>Variants:</B> Ἐφέσιος",
    2181: "Ἔφεσος (Éphesos | ef'-es-os)<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> probably of foreign origin<BR><B>Strong's:</B> Ephesus, a city of Asia Minor<BR><B>KJV:</B> Ephesus.<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> G2178 (once), G530 (once)<BR><B>Variants:</B> Ἔφεσος",
