    2187: "Ἐφραίμ (Ephraím | ef-rah-im')<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> of Hebrew origin (H669 or better H6085)<BR><B>Strong's:</B> Ephraim, a place in Palestine<BR><B>KJV:</B> Ephraim.<BR><I>See:</I> H669<BR><I>See:</I> H6085<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> G2178 (once), G530 (once)<BR><B>Variants:</B> Ἐφραίμ, Ἐφραΐμ<BR><B>Hebrew Equivalents:</B> H669 אֶפְרַיִם, H6085 עֶפְרֹון",
    2188: "ἐφφαθά (ephphathá | ef-fath-ah')<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> of Chaldee origin (H6606)<BR><B>Strong's:</B> be opened!<BR><B>KJV:</B> Ephphatha.<BR><I>See:</I> H6606<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> G2178 (once), G530 (once)<BR><B>Variants:</B> ἐφφαθά, εφφαθα<BR><B>Hebrew Equivalents:</B> H6606 פְּתַח",
