    2251: "ἡμέτερος (hēméteros | hay-met'-er-os)<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> from G2349<BR><B>Strong's:</B> our<BR><B>KJV:</B> our, your (by a different reading).<BR><BR><I>See:</I> G2349<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> G2250 (age)<BR><B>Variants:</B> ἡμέτερος",
    2252: "ἤμην (ḗmēn | ay'-mane)<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> a prolonged form of G2258<BR><B>Strong's:</B> I was<BR><B>KJV:</B> be, was. (Sometimes unexpressed).<BR><BR><I>See:</I> G2258<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> G2250 (age)<BR><B>Variants:</B> ἤμην, εἰμί",
