    2280: "Θαδδαῖος (Thaddaîos | thad-dah'-yos)<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> of uncertain origin<BR><B>Strong's:</B> Thaddæus, one of the Apostles<BR><B>KJV:</B> Thaddæus.<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> G2278 (roar)<BR><B>Variants:</B> Θαδδαῖος",
