    2970: "κῶμος (kōmos | ko'-mos)<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> from G2749<BR><B>Strong's:</B> a carousal (as if letting loose)<BR><B>KJV:</B> revelling, rioting.<BR><BR><I>See:</I> G2749<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> G2970 (revelling)<BR><B>Variants:</B> κῶμος",
