    2972: "Κώς (Kṓs | koce)<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> of uncertain origin<BR><B>Strong's:</B> Cos, an island in the Mediterranean<BR><B>KJV:</B> Cos.<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> G2972 (Cos)<BR><B>Variants:</B> Κώς, Κῶς",
