    2977: "λάθρα (láthra | lath'-rah)<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> adverb from G2990<BR><B>Strong's:</B> privately<BR><B>KJV:</B> privily, secretly.<BR><BR><I>See:</I> G2990<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> G2975 (his lot be)<BR><B>Variants:</B> λάθρα, λάθρᾳ, σιωπῇ<BR><B>Hebrew Equivalents:</B> H4565 מִסְתָּר, H5643 סֵתֶר",
