    3197: "Μελχί (Melchí | mel-khee')<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> of Hebrew origin (H4428 with pronominal suffix, my king)<BR><B>Strong's:</B> Melchi (i.e. Malki), the name of two Israelites<BR><B>KJV:</B> Melchi.<BR><I>See:</I> H4428<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> G3196 (member)<BR><B>Variants:</B> Μελχί<BR><B>Hebrew Equivalents:</B> H4428 מֶלֶךְ",
