    3199: "μέλω (mélō | mel'-o)<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> a primary verb<BR><B>Strong's:</B> to be of interest to, i.e. to concern (only third person singular present indicative used impersonally, it matters)<BR><B>KJV:</B> (take) care.<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> G3198 (Melchisedec)<BR><B>Variants:</B> μέλω, μέλει<BR><B>Hebrew Equivalents:</B> H2656 חֵפֶץ",
    3200: "μεμβράνα (membrána | mem-bran'-ah)<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> of Latin origin (\"membrane\")<BR><B>Strong's:</B> a (written) sheep-skin<BR><B>KJV:</B> parchment.<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> G3198 (Melchisedec)<BR><B>Variants:</B> μεμβράνα",
