    3586: "ξύλον (xýlon | xoo'-lon)<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> from another form of the base of G3582<BR><B>Strong's:</B> timber (as fuel or material); by implication, a stick, club or tree or other wooden article or substance<BR><B>KJV:</B> staff, stocks, tree, wood.<BR><BR><I>See:</I> G3582<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> G3585 (of wood), G3586 (staff)<BR><B>Variants:</B> ξύλον<BR><B>Hebrew Equivalents:</B> H5097 נַהֲלֹל, H5465 סַד, H6086 עֵץ, H6763 צֵלָע",
