    3588: "ὁ (ho | ho), including the feminine ἡ (hē | hay), and the neuter τό (tó | to)<BR><BR> in all their inflections<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> the definite article<BR><B>Strong's:</B> the (sometimes to be supplied, at others omitted, in English idiom)<BR><B>KJV:</B> the, this, that, one, he, she, it, etc.<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> G3587 (shave)<BR><B>Variants:</B> ὁ",
    3589: "ὀγδοήκοντα (ogdoḗkonta | og-do-ay'-kon-tah)<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> from G3590<BR><B>Strong's:</B> ten times eight<BR><B>KJV:</B> fourscore.<BR><BR><I>See:</I> G3590<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> G3589 (fourscore), G3590 (eighth)<BR><B>Variants:</B> ὀγδοήκοντα",
