    3591: "ὄγκος (ónkos | ong'-kos)<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> probably from the same as G43<BR><B>Strong's:</B> a mass (as bending or bulging by its load), i.e. burden (hindrance)<BR><B>KJV:</B> weight.<BR><BR><I>See:</I> G43<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> G3591 (weight)<BR><B>Variants:</B> ὄγκος",
