    3622: "οἰκονομία (oikonomía | oy-kon-om-ee'-ah)<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> from G3623<BR><B>Strong's:</B> administration (of a household or estate); specially, a (religious) \"economy\"<BR><B>KJV:</B> dispensation, stewardship.<BR><BR><I>See:</I> G3623<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> G3618 (build), G2733 (habitation), G3614 (home), G3617 (goodman), G3619 (building), G3616 (guide the house), G2731 (dwelling), G3622 (dispensation), G3615 (they of household), G3613 (habitation), G4925 (build together), G2732 (habitation), G3624 (home), G3611 (dwell), G3620 (edifying), G3621 (be steward), G2026 (build thereon), G3609 (of the house), G3623 (chamberlain)<BR><B>Variants:</B> οἰκονομία<BR><B>Hebrew Equivalents:</B> H4475 מֶמְשָׁלָה, H4673 מַצָּב",
