    3634: "οἷος (hoîos | hoy'-os)<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> probably akin to G3588, G3739, and G3745<BR><B>Strong's:</B> such or what sort of (as a correlation or exclamation); especially the neuter (adverbially) with negative, not so<BR><B>KJV:</B> so (as), such as, what (manner of), which.<BR><BR><I>See:</I> G3745<BR><I>See:</I> G3588<BR><I>See:</I> G3739<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> G3630 (winebibber), G3631 (wine)<BR><B>Variants:</B> οἷος, οἵος",
