    3644: "ὀλοθρευτής (olothreutḗs | ol-oth-ryoo-tace')<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> from G3645<BR><B>Strong's:</B> a ruiner, i.e. (specially), a venomous serpent<BR><B>KJV:</B> destroyer.<BR><BR><I>See:</I> G3645<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> G3644 (destroyer), G3639 (destruction), G3645 (destroy), G1842 (destroy)<BR><B>Variants:</B> ὀλοθρευτής, ὀλεθρευτής",
