    3646: "ὁλοκαύτωμα (holokaútōma | hol-ok-ow'-to-mah)<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> from a derivative of a compound of G3650 and a derivative of G2545<BR><B>Strong's:</B> a wholly-consumed sacrifice (\"holocaust\")<BR><B>KJV:</B> (whole) burnt offering.<BR><BR><I>See:</I> G3650<BR><I>See:</I> G2545<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> G3644 (destroyer), G3639 (destruction), G3645 (destroy), G1842 (destroy)<BR><B>Variants:</B> ὁλοκαύτωμα<BR><B>Hebrew Equivalents:</B> H801 אִשָּׁה, H2113 זְוָעָה, H3632 כָּלִיל, H4503 מִנְחָה, H5930 עֹלָה",
