    3652: "Ὀλυμπᾶς (Olympâs | ol-oom-pas')<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> probably a contraction from Ὀλυμπιόδωρος (Olympian-bestowed, i.e. heaven-descended)<BR><B>Strong's:</B> Olympas, a Christian<BR><B>KJV:</B> Olympas.<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> G3650 (all), G3651 (wholly)<BR><B>Variants:</B> Ὀλυμπᾶς",
