    3688: "ὄνος (ónos | on'-os)<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> apparently a primary word<BR><B>Strong's:</B> a donkey<BR><B>KJV:</B> an ass.<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> G3678 (young ass), G3688 (an ass)<BR><B>Variants:</B> ὄνος<BR><B>Hebrew Equivalents:</B> H860 אָתֹון, H2543 חֲמֹור, H5679 עֲבָרָה, H5895 עַיִר, H6501 פֶּרֶא",
