    3807: "παιδαγωγός (paidagōgós | pahee-dag-o-gos')<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> from G3816 and a reduplicated form of G71<BR><B>Strong's:</B> a boy-leader, i.e. a servant whose office it was to take the children to school; (by implication, (figuratively) a tutor (\"pædagogue\"))<BR><B>KJV:</B>  instructor, schoolmaster.<BR><BR><I>See:</I> G3816<BR><I>See:</I> G71<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> G3811 (chasten), G3809 (chastening), G521 (unlearned), G3807 (instructor), G3810 (which corrected)<BR><B>Variants:</B> παιδαγωγός",
