    3812: "παιδιόθεν (paidióthen | pahee-dee-oth'-en)<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> adverb (of source) from G3813<BR><B>Strong's:</B> from infancy<BR><B>KJV:</B> of a child.<BR><BR><I>See:</I> G3813<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> G3814 (bondmaid), G3813 (child), G3808 (child), G3816 (child), G3812 (of a child)<BR><B>Variants:</B> παιδιόθεν, παιδόθεν",
