    3815: "παίζω (paízō | paheed'-zo)<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> from G3816<BR><B>Strong's:</B> to sport (as a boy)<BR><B>KJV:</B> play.<BR><BR><I>See:</I> G3816<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> G3814 (bondmaid), G3813 (child), G3808 (child), G3816 (child), G3812 (of a child)<BR><B>Variants:</B> παίζω<BR><B>Hebrew Equivalents:</B> H5913 עָכַס, H6711 צָחַק, H7832 שָׂחַק",
