    3819: "πάλαι (pálai | pal'-ahee)<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> probably another form for G3825 (through the idea of retrocession)<BR><B>Strong's:</B> (adverbially) formerly, or (by relatively) sometime since; (elliptically as adjective) ancient<BR><B>KJV:</B> any while, a great while ago, (of) old, in time past.<BR><BR><I>See:</I> G3825<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> G3821 (oldness), G3819 (any while), G3822 (decay), G3820 (old)<BR><B>Variants:</B> πάλαι<BR><B>Hebrew Equivalents:</B> H227 אָז, H7350 רָחֹוק",
