    3827: "πάμπολυς (pámpolys | pam-pol-ooce)<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> from G3956 and G4183<BR><B>Strong's:</B> full many, i.e. immense<BR><B>KJV:</B> very great.<BR><BR><I>See:</I> G3956<BR><I>See:</I> G4183<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> G1085 (born), G1078 (generation), G3824 (regeneration), G1096 (arise), G581 (being dead), G1081 (fruit)<BR><B>Variants:</B> πάμπολυς G4102",
