    4017: "περιβλέπω (periblépō | per-ee-blep'-o)<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> from G4012 and G991<BR><B>Strong's:</B> to look all around<BR><B>KJV:</B> look (round) about (on).<BR><BR><I>See:</I> G4012<BR><I>See:</I> G991<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> G4012 (about)<BR><B>Variants:</B> περιβλέπω, περιβλέπομαι<BR><B>Hebrew Equivalents:</B> H5027 נָבַט, H6213 עָשָׂה, H6437 פָּנָה, H7789 שׁוּר",
    4018: "περιβόλαιον (peribólaion | per-ib-ol'-ah-yon)<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> neuter of a presumed derivative of G4016<BR><B>Strong's:</B> something thrown around one, i.e. a mantle, veil<BR><B>KJV:</B> covering, vesture.<BR><BR><I>See:</I> G4016<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> G4012 (about)<BR><B>Variants:</B> περιβόλαιον<BR><B>Hebrew Equivalents:</B> H899 בֶּגֶד, H3682 כְּסוּת, H3830 לְבוּשׁ, H4555 מִסְפָּחָה",
