    4020: "περιεργάζομαι (periergázomai | per-ee-er-gad'-zom-ahee)<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> from G4012 and G2038<BR><B>Strong's:</B> to work all around, i.e. bustle about (meddle)<BR><B>KJV:</B> be a busybody.<BR><BR><I>See:</I> G4012<BR><I>See:</I> G2038<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> G4012 (about)<BR><B>Variants:</B> περιεργάζομαι",
    4021: "περίεργος (períergos | per-ee'-er-gos)<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> from G4012 and G2041<BR><B>Strong's:</B> working all around, i.e. officious (meddlesome, neuter plural magic)<BR><B>KJV:</B> busybody, curious arts.<BR><BR><I>See:</I> G4012<BR><I>See:</I> G2041<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> G4012 (about)<BR><B>Variants:</B> περίεργος",
