    4432: "πτωχεία (ptōcheía | pto-khi'-ah)<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> from G4433<BR><B>Strong's:</B> beggary, i.e. indigence (literally or figuratively)<BR><B>KJV:</B> poverty.<BR><BR><I>See:</I> G4433<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> G4433 (become poor), G4434 (beggar), G4432 (poverty), G4431 (fall)<BR><B>Variants:</B> πτωχεία<BR><B>Hebrew Equivalents:</B> H4544 מִסְכֵּנֻת, H6040 עֳנִי",
