    4553: "σαργάνη (sargánē | sar-gan'-ay)<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> apparently of Hebrew origin (H8276)<BR><B>Strong's:</B> a basket (as interwoven or wicker-work<BR><B>KJV:</B> basket.<BR><I>See:</I> H8276<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> G4550 (bad), G4595 (be corrupted)<BR><B>Variants:</B> σαργάνη<BR><B>Hebrew Equivalents:</B> H8276 שָׂרַג",
