    4748: "στοιχέω (stoichéō | stoy-kheh'-o)<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> from a derivative of στείχω (to range in regular line)<BR><B>Strong's:</B> to march in (military) rank (keep step), i.e. (figuratively) to conform to virtue and piety<BR><B>KJV:</B> walk (orderly).<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> G4747 (element), G4748 (walk), G4960 (answer to)<BR><B>Variants:</B> στοιχέω<BR><B>Hebrew Equivalents:</B> H3787 כָּשֵׁר",
