    4954: "σύσσωμος (sýssōmos | soos'-so-mos)<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> from G4862 and G4983<BR><B>Strong's:</B> of a joint body, i.e. (figuratively) a fellow-member of the Christian community<BR><B>KJV:</B> of the same body.<BR><BR><I>See:</I> G4862<BR><I>See:</I> G4983<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> G4985 (bodily), G4984 (bodily), G4983 (bodily), G4954 (of the same body)<BR><B>Variants:</B> σύσσωμος",
    4955: "συστασιαστής (systasiastḗs | soos-tas-ee-as-tace')<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> from a compound of G4862 and a derivative of G4714<BR><B>Strong's:</B> a fellow-insurgent<BR><B>KJV:</B> make insurrection with.<BR><BR><I>See:</I> G4862<BR><I>See:</I> G4714<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> G4955 (make insurrection with), G4714 (dissension)<BR><B>Variants:</B> συστασιαστής, στασιαστής",
