    4990: "σωτήρ (sōtḗr | so-tare')<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> from G4982<BR><B>Strong's:</B> a deliverer, i.e. God or Christ<BR><B>KJV:</B> saviour.<BR><BR><I>See:</I> G4982<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> G4991 (deliver), G4990 (saviour), G4992 (salvation), G4982 (heal)<BR><B>Variants:</B> σωτήρ<BR><B>Hebrew Equivalents:</B> H3444 יְשׁוּעָה, H3467 יָשַׁע, H3468 יֶשַׁע",
