    5000: "Ταβιθά (Tabithá | tab-ee-thah')<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> of Chaldee origin (compare H6646)<BR><B>Strong's:</B> the gazelle; Tabitha (i.e. Tabjetha), a Christian female<BR><B>KJV:</B> Tabitha.<BR><I>See:</I> H6646<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> G4998 (discreet), G4995 (sound mind), G4994 (teach to be sober), G4996 (soberly), G4997 (soberness), G4993 (be in right mind)<BR><B>Variants:</B> Ταβιθά, Ταβηθά<BR><B>Hebrew Equivalents:</B> H6646 צְבִיָּה",
