    5004: "ταλαιπωρία (talaipōría | tal-ahee-po-ree'-ah)<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> from G5005<BR><B>Strong's:</B> wretchedness, i.e. calamity<BR><B>KJV:</B> misery.<BR><BR><I>See:</I> G5005<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> G1296 (instrumentality), G657 (bid farewell), G5021 (addict), G813 (unruly), G4367 (bid), G5292 (subjection), G1297 (commandment), G2004 (charge), G5293 (be under obedience), G506 (disobedient), G814 (disorderly), G1299 (appoint), G5001 (order), G812 (behave self disorderly), G392 (set in order)<BR><B>Variants:</B> ταλαιπωρία<BR><B>Hebrew Equivalents:</B> H4113 מַהֲמֹרָה, H4285 מַחְשָׁךְ, H5136 נוּשׁ, H7588 שָׁאֹון, H7667 שֶׁבֶר, H7701 שֹׁד, H7722 שֹׁוא",
