    5006: "ταλαντιαῖος (talantiaîos | tal-an-tee-ah'-yos)<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> from G5007<BR><B>Strong's:</B> talent-like in weight<BR><B>KJV:</B> weight of a talent.<BR><BR><I>See:</I> G5007<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> G1296 (instrumentality), G657 (bid farewell), G5021 (addict), G813 (unruly), G4367 (bid), G5292 (subjection), G1297 (commandment), G2004 (charge), G5293 (be under obedience), G506 (disobedient), G814 (disorderly), G1299 (appoint), G5001 (order), G812 (behave self disorderly), G392 (set in order)<BR><B>Variants:</B> ταλαντιαῖος",
