    5078: "τέχνη (téchnē | tekh'-nay)<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> from the base of G5088<BR><B>Strong's:</B> art (as productive), i.e. (specially), a trade, or (generally) skill<BR><B>KJV:</B> art, craft, occupation.<BR><BR><I>See:</I> G5088<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> G5065 (fourteenth), G5073 (fourfold), G5070 (four thousand), G5069 (quaternion), G5067 (four), G5062 (forty), G5064 (four), G5074 (fourfooted beast), G5075 (tetrarch), G5072 (four months), G5066 (four days), G5063 (forty years), G5071 (four hundred), G5076 (tetrarch), G5068 (foursquare)<BR><B>Variants:</B> τέχνη<BR><B>Hebrew Equivalents:</B> H2451 חׇכְמָה, H4639 מַעֲשֶׂה, H5656 עֲבֹדָה",
    5079: "τεχνίτης (technítēs | tekh-nee'-tace)<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> from G5078<BR><B>Strong's:</B> an artisan; figuratively, a founder (Creator)<BR><B>KJV:</B> builder, craftsman.<BR><BR><I>See:</I> G5078<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> G5065 (fourteenth), G5073 (fourfold), G5070 (four thousand), G5069 (quaternion), G5067 (four), G5062 (forty), G5064 (four), G5074 (fourfooted beast), G5075 (tetrarch), G5072 (four months), G5066 (four days), G5063 (forty years), G5071 (four hundred), G5076 (tetrarch), G5068 (foursquare)<BR><B>Variants:</B> τεχνίτης<BR><B>Hebrew Equivalents:</B> H542 אָמָן, H2672 חָצַב, H2796 חָרָשׁ",
    5080: "τήκω (tḗkō | tay'-ko)<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> apparently a primary verb<BR><B>Strong's:</B> to liquefy<BR><B>KJV:</B> melt.<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> G5065 (fourteenth), G5073 (fourfold), G5070 (four thousand), G5069 (quaternion), G5067 (four), G5062 (forty), G5064 (four), G5074 (fourfooted beast), G5075 (tetrarch), G5072 (four months), G5066 (four days), G5063 (forty years), G5071 (four hundred), G5076 (tetrarch), G5068 (foursquare)<BR><B>Variants:</B> τήκω, τήκομαι<BR><B>Hebrew Equivalents:</B> H1234 בָּקַע, H1671 דְּאָבֹון, H2215 זָרַב, H3615 כָּלָה, H4127 מוּג, H4198 מָזֶה, H4529 מָסָה, H4549 מָסַס, H4743 מָקַק, H5140 נָזַל, H5413 נָתַךְ, H7817 שָׁחַח, H8552 תָּמַם",
