    5491: "χεῖλος (cheîlos | khi'-los)<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> from a form of the same as G5490<BR><B>Strong's:</B> a lip (as a pouring place); figuratively, a margin (of water)<BR><B>KJV:</B> lip, shore.<BR><BR><I>See:</I> G5490<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> G5479 (gladness), G4796 (rejoice in), G2168 (thank), G2169 (thankfulness), G5485 (acceptable), G5486 (gift), G5463 (farewell), G5484 (be- cause of), G2170 (thankful), G5487 (make accepted), G884 (unthankful), G5483 (deliver)<BR><B>Variants:</B> χεῖλος<BR><B>Hebrew Equivalents:</B> H561 אֵמֶר, H3027 יָד, H3895 לְחִי, H6310 פֶּה, H8193 שָׂפָה",
