    5552: "χρύσεος (chrýseos | khroo'-seh-os)<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> from G5557<BR><B>Strong's:</B> made of gold<BR><B>KJV:</B> of gold, golden.<BR><BR><I>See:</I> G5557<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> G5550 (+ years old), G5549 (delay), G5551 (spend time)<BR><B>Variants:</B> χρύσεος, χρυσοῦς<BR><B>Hebrew Equivalents:</B> H2091 זָהָב, H6337 פָּז",
