    5563: "χωρίζω (chōrízō | kho-rid'-zo)<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> from G5561<BR><B>Strong's:</B> to place room between, i.e. part; reflexively, to go away<BR><B>KJV:</B> depart, put asunder, separate.<BR><BR><I>See:</I> G5561<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> G5550 (+ years old), G5549 (delay), G5551 (spend time)<BR><B>Variants:</B> χωρίζω<BR><B>Hebrew Equivalents:</B> H910 בָּדָד, H914 בָּדַל, H4185 מוּשׁ, H6504 פָּרַד",
