    5569: "ψευδάδελφος (pseudádelphos | psyoo-dad'-el-fos)<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> from G5571 and G80<BR><B>Strong's:</B> a spurious brother, i.e. pretended associate<BR><B>KJV:</B> false brethren.<BR><BR><I>See:</I> G5571<BR><I>See:</I> G80<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> G5361 (love as brethren), G80 (brother), G81 (brethren), G5360 (brotherly love), G79 (sister), G5569 (false brethren)<BR><B>Variants:</B> ψευδάδελφος",
    5570: "ψευδαπόστολος (pseudapóstolos | psyoo-dap-os'-tol-os)<BR><BR><B>Derivation:</B> from G5571 and G652<BR><B>Strong's:</B> a spurious apostle, i.e. pretended preacher<BR><B>KJV:</B> false teacher.<BR><BR><I>See:</I> G5571<BR><I>See:</I> G652<BR><BR><B>Cognate Group:</B> G651 (apostleship), G649 (put in), G5570 (false teacher), G1821 (send), G652 (apostle), G3992 (send)<BR><B>Variants:</B> ψευδαπόστολος",
